<title>USA: Davis Jt USD, Calif., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Davis Jt USD, Calif., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $19.435 million of Davis Joint Unified Sch Dist, Calif., refunding series 1996 special tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.651 percent.</p>
</text>
